heroes of our party be prepared. Let my brother Kumbhakarņa and other leading night-rangers, armed with various weapons, ascend their conveyances. Having slain today in the encounter that Madhu, who is not afraid of Ravana, I shall, encircled by my friends, and desirous of battle, proceed to the region of the celestials.","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":0.448,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-25-22","DUTT-7-25-23"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7025029","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"c0d3f43ffca208fd036b00047996bf9eead9be234431af13d58d2a22049212c6","compact":"af767df34383c1ec0b561ef669606ed964110e27c252a0b30a2c0516b9bb6218","nasal":"8bbb7569ad721eb55537b24bccb5e163007c7cf987dc8b0043b014f943b48477"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-25-30","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":25,"verse":30,"english":"Get my chariot ready soon and let all the heroes of our party be prepared. Let my brother Kumbhakarņa and other leading night-rangers, armed with various weapons, ascend their conveyances. Having slain today in the encounter that Madhu, who is not afraid of Ravana, I shall, encircled by my friends, and desirous of battle, proceed to the region of the celestials.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-25-23"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7025030","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"f52ea5b7f9128ed01f46be6f56664156a3daf2687a7ba46479af7c32e5f77c87","compact":"c10eabf9da4f0c357b09d6d759a9b2e2c11f2d6ff63e509c513813e16ba53af8","nasal":"8e55d8157f752be3392e90c0af0a0815b805edf14e8731e79cb9f0cacfdd38ba"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-25-31","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":25,"verse":31,"english":"Get my chariot ready soon and let all the heroes of our party be prepared. Let my brother Kumbhakarņa and other leading night-rangers, armed with vario