d Madhu but espied his sister.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-25-26"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7025038","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"db45df2915ccfe2a4794904a35ef2f27242c7ef51a15b0ce986a0a3b0d2faf4d","compact":"1370b22b0a2a09f7b9e90a93c6674f07c0bb0d5a137e474349253aa4cccda897","nasal":"1370b22b0a2a09f7b9e90a93c6674f07c0bb0d5a137e474349253aa4cccda897"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-25-39","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":25,"verse":39,"english":"Thereupon being afraid of the king of Raksasas, Kumbhinasi, with folded palms, touched his feet with her crown.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.423,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-25-27"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7025039","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"16cbe35466d9df1e0f2a0351d6961c5bb431b25aa3714fe8c7ebf0b0699a635a","compact":"8e9ff395dc00015d0826b1527f136f319493a36ed294d2ceab8def5edc0b5703","nasal":"e783031699882cb479fc19045071fd13fef0b3236fad17710eaa629e98634402"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-25-40","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":25,"verse":40,"english":"Having raised her up the Rākşasa-chief Ravana said “No fear, what can I do for you?","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-25-28"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7025040","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"ca3c51efc7006a4537f769337cb41ea7168e732eb91ec251aed3fc96c8a442d7","compact":"f14395f5fb7174c32920d896032f2df4f2e795f3eb9d36e693f8335ca6fef651","nasal":"f14395f5fb7174c32920d896032f2df4f2e795f3eb9d36e693f8335ca6fef651"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-25-41","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":25,"verse":41,"english":"Where to she replied “O King, O you having long arms, if you